RT-SEMamba real-time app

This repository contains the real-time demo application of RT-SEMamba:
https://github.com/RoyChao19477/RT-SEMamba

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party code

models/mps_kernels.py contains a Metal selective-scan kernel adapted from
SpeechLens (https://github.com/faraday/SpeechLens),
Sources/Inference/MetalSelectiveScan.swift:

