Modifications: ported from MLX/Swift to PyTorch (torch.mps.compile_shader);
the SSM state is read from and written back to a caller-owned buffer so the
kernel supports stateful chunked streaming.

mamba_install/ and mamba_install_mps/ vendor mamba_ssm
(https://github.com/state-spaces/mamba), licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0; see mamba_install*/LICENSE. In mamba_install_mps, __init__.py,
models/mixer_seq_simple.py, utils/generation.py and utils/hf.py were modified
so that `transformers` is optional (only needed for the language-model classes).
